to column of cell in grid, giving back a number:
    give back cell mod grid.
to range from low to high:
    let numbers be an empty list of numbers.
    count from low to high as n:
        add n to the end of numbers.
    give back numbers.
say the column of 7 in 4.
say column of 7 and 4.
say range from 1 to 5.
let board width be 3.
say "Column:", the column of 10 in board width.
a dog has a name (text).
a dog can fetch with toy to place:
    say dog's name, "takes the", toy, "to the", place.
let rex be a new dog with name "Rex".
fetch rex with "ball" to "garden".
to slide with piece from start to finish by steps:
    say "Sliding", piece, "from", start, "to", finish, "by", steps.
slide with "pawn" from "a2" to "a3" by 1.
slide with "rook" from "h1" to "h4" by 2 plus 1.
